# Architecture

- Client layers: `ui → domain → data` (dependencies inward only)
- Domain has no platform SDK imports
- **Android:** feature ViewModels, repos per OpenAPI domain, UDF — see `kotlin-android.mdc`
- API changes start in `docs/openapi.yaml`, then tests, then code
- Offline-first: local cache + sync when online
- Client playback UX → [`docs/client-user-flows.md`](docs/client-user-flows.md)
- Audiobook progress syncs; music progress is local only
- Auth: expired JWT offline ≠ logout; refresh only when online
- Desktop: close/minimize → tray; quit only via tray menu
